00:01:27.883 --> 00:01:28.914
This is funny,

00:01:28.914 --> 00:01:30.208
I'm gonna laugh.
- It's hard.

00:01:30.208 --> 00:01:31.041
Yes.

00:01:31.041 --> 00:01:31.874
I heard something about you though

00:01:31.874 --> 00:01:32.707
that we have a similarity.

00:01:32.707 --> 00:01:34.220
My mom was single for quite some time too

00:01:34.220 --> 00:01:35.812
